sequence-diagram

title Voting phase
activate Voter
Voter [icon: user-check, color: darkorchid] > Python [icon: python, color: blue]: Runs Vote(id, (sk_id = cr_id, t_id)), pk_T, v)
Python > Python: Computes e_v = enc_pk_T(v;r) 
opt [label: Case of nullifying previous vote v_pre to vote for v_new] {
Voter > Python: v = v_new-v_pre
}
Python > Python: Computes zero-knowledge proof π_id with the proving key pk
Python > Anonnymous Channel [icon: eye-off, color: blue]: Submit ballot β
Anonnymous Channel > PostgreSQL (BB) [icon: database, color: green]: Forward ballot β
deactivate Voter
activate PostgreSQL (BB)
PostgreSQL (BB) > Python: Runs Validate(β)
Python > Python: Checks if proof on ballot is valid, and if ballot already exists on BB

alt [label: if valid] {
    Python > Python: Append(BB, β)
    Python > PostgreSQL (BB): Append β
    Python > PostgreSQL (BB): : Verify β is appended
    Python < PostgreSQL (BB): : Confirm β appended
    Python > Voter: β is appended successfully
    loop [label: for each null ballot] {
        PostgreSQL (BB) > Python: Encrypt null vote
        Python > PostgreSQL (BB): Encrypted null vote e_0
        PostgreSQL (BB) > Python: Generate null proof π_id
        Python:  > PostgreSQL(BB): Proof πid for null ballot
        PostgreSQL (BB) > PostgreSQL (BB): Append null ballot
    }
}
else [label: if invalid] {
    PostgreSQL (BB) > Voter: Invalid ballot notification
}
deactivate PostgreSQL (BB)

